- **Default Action:**
  - In the absence of significant angles or velocities, take a default action (or no action) to maintain balance.

This updated strategy aims to be more proactive in maintaining balance by considering both the angle and velocity of the pole, and applying appropriate corrective actions based on thresholds. This should help in achieving better performance and keeping the pole balanced for longer periods.
