        if pole_angle > angle_threshold or pole_angular_velocity > angular_velocity_threshold:
            action = 2  # Move right to counterbalance the lean
        elif pole_angle < -angle_threshold or pole_angular_velocity < -angular_velocity_threshold:
            action = 0  # Move left to counterbalance the lean
        else:
            action = 1  # No action if everything is balanced
    
    return action
```

